# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — top-up-gamer-analyst (repo dokumentasi analisis)
# Repo ini HANYA berisi dokumen analisis (PRD, SRS, ERD, dsb).
# Tidak ada kode aplikasi, tidak ada .env, tidak ada secret.
# =============================================================================

# --- Env & secret (jaga-jaga bila suatu saat folder ini diisi kode) ----------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json
.netrc

# --- Tracker internal & artefak proses (milik repo aplikasi, jangan ikut) -----
.scratch/
.hallmark/
docs/adr/

# --- Dependency & build ------------------------------------------------------
/vendor/
/node_modules/
/public/build/
/public/hot
/storage/*.key

# --- Cache / log / OS --------------------------------------------------------
.cache/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# --- Editor -------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
